       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\nIbuprofen 4000 mg four times daily comes to 16,000 mg per day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg per day (typically 800 mg per dose, up to four times daily) in a monitored setting. This order is five times that limit and would risk severe GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and metabolic and CNS toxicity. Normal kidney and liver function wouldn't make it safe.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **400 mg** by mouth four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg** by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do want 4000 mg per dose, please confirm that explicitly. I'd still suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
